  m_Text: "Request deletion of:\n\u2022 Account, cloud profile and class entitlements\n\u2022
    Gem, achievement and attendance records\n\u2022 Support messages and diagnostics\n\nYour
    local worlds are kept. Minimal purchase records may be retained under the reviewed
    retention policy.\n\nDeletion cannot be undone. The request is processed before
    deletion completes."
